The text of the acts in this repository is published by Grønlands Selvstyre on Nalunaarutit (https://nalunaarutit.gl),
Greenland's official electronic law collection. No terms of use or reuse licence were found on the site when the data
was retrieved (2026-10-28): the page "Om Nalunaarutit.gl" describes what the collection holds and gives the contact
nsninatsit@nanoq.gl, and robots.txt disallows only /sitecore/. Whether the text of Greenlandic acts is free of copyright
in the way Danish acts are (ophavsretsloven § 9, which also applies in Greenland by anordning) has not been decided here.
No reuse licence is claimed for the text of the acts. Attribution: Source: Nalunaarutit, Grønlands Selvstyre,
https://nalunaarutit.gl. This repository is not endorsed by Grønlands Selvstyre.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is dedicated
to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

To the extent possible under law, Lexifina has waived all copyright and related or neighbouring rights to this work.

This repository is private because the reuse terms for the text are not clear. It has not been decided here whether the
repository will be published; that needs the terms to be settled first.
